{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/a471eaace93807b06f1160d322949ac1d43d22a72014973566003410b56dcdb448896454f10694296d838d29e140db3dd34f47469d8e74c644f429e26a4ae516","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/R9tuZLHrIlYGWAS1D63bvEO3WCtvBTBxCXlGnvSsxJ1KKXVU6iFEMkgCstiFg2s_9BpsaB3oyGnUrVzGWinsV_Xg9AaWP2bKQ0R1RFNh1sAopGo4VAo","width":600},"name":"Rebecca Hsiao","title":"Interaction Designer, Fonts"},"document_id":5320141765214208,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/369c95fe5019b07e689d250a71b99f23e954b4b1e7288cc521f9534e2f1b26e3402000d0d9b0ec2b449c286617c23522d81fa4a5aad5de6e88a30a6f158b944d","height":212,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WXzPP98RdDrDneOh7QCxSdNkjwk9_ACKefFU5vhW7DtED5EeHavMyWl7ttNSOzpRiLZqvYoZCQxVwxJ7Bi47CN8h4tj_nqxjuTsH1szGG5nt1dZgwtr1","width":212},"name":"Susanna Zaraysky","title":"Content Strategist, Fonts"},"document_id":6292121203769344,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/ad219924c4bb2d91f50ea3f0d02ad7c0f7b78a58f71e3abbe5386d46a1ec88165d74e2c1fbc6322ee4a918d2dce862db4aca4bf41e66bfa95876605f41a67a3f","height":720,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/hd0T1kKtCYRBkTsXl1W4QVdsQlsEZGKi8kXMl_LzXATv3fO4XF2j0n0VG-QbospUO0atnzoAqyteuvv_LRknNAgAHUBG4OuZrIVnKr7eTEIZGe8xBwY","width":720},"name":"Google Fonts","title":null},"document_id":4984898311028736,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Fonts</a> 很自豪地提供许多旨在让阅读更轻松的字体。网站上还有一些字体，经一些国际教育机构批准用于教育材料和书写教学。</p>\n<p>下面你将看到关于这些字体，以及与可读性、易读性和文本无障碍相关的其他主题的文章摘要。</p>\n<p>如果你想查看下方所列任意字体的使用统计数据，请前往 fonts.google.com 上任意 specimen 页面的 About 部分，并滚动至 Usage 部分。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<h2>为提升无障碍性而设计的字体</h2>\n<p>按字母顺序排列：</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.685%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><strong>字体</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><strong>下载链接</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\">\n<p><strong>资源</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>Andika</strong></p>\n<p>SIL 设计 Andika 字体的目的是最大化易读性，尤其面向各年龄段的新读者。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Andika\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Andika</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\"><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/sil-typefaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">全新的 SIL 字体</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>Atkinson Hyperlegible</strong></p>\n<p>Atkinson Hyperlegible 专为提升低视力读者的易读性、改善阅读理解而开发。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Atkinson+Hyperlegible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Atkinson Hyperlegible</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\"><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/atkinson-hyperlegible-design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">借助 Atkinson Hyperlegible 从品牌重塑走向可读性</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>澳大利亚手写字体</strong></p>\n<p>五款澳大利亚 Foundation 字体展示了符合澳大利亚各地区教育要求的规范手写风格。这些字体用于教授英语及其他使用拉丁书写系统的语言的书写，并包含常见的数学符号。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Edu+VIC+WA+NT+Beginner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Edu VIC WA NT Beginner</a>，适用于维多利亚州、西澳大利亚州和北领地</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Edu+NSW+ACT+Foundation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EDU NSW ACT Foundation</a>，适用于新南威尔士州和澳大利亚首都领地</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Edu+SA+Beginner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Edu SA Beginner</a>，适用于南澳大利亚州</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Edu+TAS+Beginner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Edu TAS Beginner</a>，适用于塔斯马尼亚州</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Edu+QLD+Beginner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Edu QLD Beginner</a>，适用于昆士兰州</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.googleblog.com/2022/08/the-handwriting-fonts-that-help.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">帮助澳大利亚学生学习读写的手写字体现已在 Google Workspace 中推出</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>日本 Morisawa 通用设计字体</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://en.morisawa.co.jp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Morisawa</a> 的 <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/?query=morisawa&amp;subset=japanese\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BIZ 通用设计（UD）字体家族</a>依据<a href=\"https://universaldesign.ie/what-is-universal-design/the-7-principles/the-7-principles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">通用设计原则</a>（UD）开发，以确保<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/legibility_readability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">易读性</a>（legibility）与<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/legibility_readability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">可读性</a>（readability）。它们是日本教育出版领域使用最广泛的字体。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/?query=Morisawa+Inc.&amp;subset=japanese&amp;noto.script=Jpan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Morisawa 字体</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.googleblog.com/2022/04/morisawa-biz-universal-design-ud.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Morisawa BIZ 通用设计（UD）日文字体已加入 Google Fonts 和 Google Workspace</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>Lexend</strong></p>\n<p>一位教育治疗师认为，阅读问题的一个主要因素就藏在显而易见之处——字体！她创造了一款名为 Lexend 的字体，帮助人们更好地阅读。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Lexend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Lexend</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://design.google/library/lexend-readability/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">干净而清晰：用 Lexend 让阅读更轻松</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.googleblog.com/2022/07/lexend.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">携手改变世界的阅读方式：将 Lexend 扩展出多种字重</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.googleblog.com/2022/07/lexend-deutsch.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Eine Partnerschaft mit dem Ziel, das Leseerlebnis weltweit zu ver&auml;ndern: Erweiterung von Lexend um verschiedene Schriftst&auml;rken</a>（德语）</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>Noto</strong></p>\n<p>Noto 项目为超过 1,000 种语言和超过 150 种书写系统提供字体，并为先前没有数字字体的少数族群语言提供字体。没有数字字体时，少数族群语言社区只能扫描印刷材料供人们在线阅读。这些扫描图像无法被屏幕阅读器读取，放大后往往也难以阅读。有了数字字体，人们可以增大字号，更舒适地阅读。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/noto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Noto</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.google/outreach-initiatives/accessibility/preserving-endangered-languages-noto-fonts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">用 Noto 字体守护濒危语言</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DnuDOlPkFag\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Noto Fonts：守护濒危语言与无障碍</a>（视频）</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>Readex Pro</strong></p>\n<p>Readex Pro 运用视觉研究，力求让有视觉障碍或阅读障碍的阿拉伯语读者读起来更轻松。字体设计师创作了阿拉伯文的 <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Readex+Pro#about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Readex Pro</a>，采用的是为拉丁文设计的 <a href=\"https://design.google/library/lexend-readability/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lexend</a> 背后的方法。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Readex+Pro#about\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Readex Pro</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/readex-pro-legibility-arabic-type-design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Readex Pro 的设计：探索阿拉伯文字体易读性的边界</a>（英语）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://blog.google/intl/ar-mena/company-news/outreach-initiatives/readex-arabic-accessibility/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&rlm;خط &rlm;Readex Pro: استكشاف حدود سهولة قراءة النص من خلال خط عربي جديد</a>（阿拉伯语）</p>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\">\n<p><strong>Shantell Sans</strong></p>\n<p>在发现自己有阅读障碍多年之后，艺术家兼哲学家 Shantell Martin 与 Stephen Nixon 和 Anya Danilova 合作，创造了拉丁文与西里尔文的 Shantell Sans，让人们无论与文字的关系如何，都能自信地阅读和书写。</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1006%;\"><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Shantell+Sans/about?query=shantell+sans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">下载 Shantell Sans</a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 31.1019%;\"><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/shantell-martin-variable-font\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shantell Sans 的故事：一位艺术家如何创造出拉丁文与西里尔文字体&nbsp;</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>视觉尺寸（Optical Size）可变字体</h2>\n<p>字体中的<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/optical_sizes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">视觉尺寸（optical size）</a>是指为使字体在各种尺寸下都具备最佳易读性与美感而做的设计调整。视觉尺寸对文本无障碍的影响十分显著，它在提升有视觉障碍或阅读困难人群的可读性与理解方面发挥着关键作用。</p>\n<p>较小的视觉尺寸具有更宽的字母<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/spacing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">间距</a>、更强的笔画对比和更开放的字腔（counter），以保持易读性；而较大的视觉尺寸则专注于打磨细节与比例，以追求美感。通过为特定场景选择合适的视觉尺寸，设计师可以确保文本既具有视觉吸引力，又易于阅读。</p>\n<p>了解更多：<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/choosing_type/choosing_typefaces_that_have_optical_sizes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">如何选择带有视觉尺寸的字体</a></p>\n<p>要查找带有视觉尺寸轴的字体，请前往<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/variablefonts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">可变字体页面</a>，并按照以下步骤操作：</p>\n<p>第 1 步：在下拉菜单中选择“opsz”。</p>\n<p>第 2 步：&nbsp; 滚动浏览可用字体列表并选择一款。</p>\n<p>第 3 步：前往 Type Tester，查看所选文本在有无视觉尺寸轴时的变化。</p>\n<h2>关于阅读研究、可读性与字体无障碍的信息</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/readability_and_accessibility/how_type_influences_readability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">字体如何影响可读性</a></p>\n<p>本文简要概述了人们的阅读方式，重点关注视力正常或经矫正（佩戴眼镜或隐形眼镜）的人如何阅读字母、单词、短语和更长的文本。（本文不涉及盲文的使用。）本概述还介绍了字体排印决策会如何影响阅读过程。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/readability_and_accessibility/introducing_accessibility_in_typography\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">字体排印中的无障碍入门</a></p>\n<p>本文讨论了无障碍字体的选择、排版、颜色、文字大小与间距、超链接、非文本元素以及图像中的文本。</p>\n<p>&mdash;</p>\n<p>这是一篇持续更新的博客文章，如果有关于无障碍文本的新文章或新公告，本文可能会随之更新。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"User types Lexend in search bar, clicks on the Lexend tile to access the specimen page , clicks on About & license, cursor highlights the Usage statistics section heading.","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/ec45d4f63e263a51759e5c2c6bdb8db43914e1a9ef36edfb0e887a204ee3384565ceb99171c9e0c2d8ff2f7b3028884ad6be3c66546395cf722d19a9187df292","height":645,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gX6011rfNv6r6wTsVqK3Ox9MLEpYf5P4mxfTh0OMRTE1COyDJi6-xsRhwa9hjMGZ-bvfuCZHNHPrpx83pe4w-_mxI6qtY-9lLHXw_cQ-KRt7EzyrGg","width":1200}},{"a11y_description":"Animation of cursor selecting “opsz” in dropdown menu, selecting Piazzola font, changing toggle to select optical size in Type Tester","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/d0b71b5cd286c5c6c03380e69f87e65fff430b9d31a91b97e66979f0f741cb2bc22b8a5cf0f12b6e394ebc6a6cd0dd0ac9fe042c22d892e237ebf738c69c1baa","height":639,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/2EXnIDLiyZmiqYOA7BKTrLKog-JKoZBA8adhbfRCSPuy3OwMdeIlbMFG0Y8o6yRgqIlt3Flr5X8Px1Zty0IOGOqljewChfOrsYziDdopTi-EvwaH9sg","width":1200}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2023","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/96e07796edc102ddbbf2f1a4b07964edfa638dad09eab71f7a9a95110cf44dfb7eabc9e261907985e0fbe64c93209ab1820e4d70881223db693c35a27e002c5e","height":1536,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VfKcfwY0D55KIqGuq4dDDQcAHl4gQbVeE3BXx8R-qjSSwFIMJ9KFFCqw3g9LWYlajtQPML-mNdjMOYTHDbxm2BfD77Xq-eNWstVyclHD5yKVDJx6C6k","width":3411}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":null,"meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":null,"share_image":{},"share_title":null},"published_date":"2023-05-12T13:00:00","slug":"how-to-make-text-more-accessible","subtitle":"在 Google Fonts 查找所有字体、文章与资源，让你的文本更易于阅读","title":"如何让你的文本更无障碍","up_next":{"items":[]},"document_id":"6578576280387584"}